  "title": "Govern AI models, tools, and agents with Azure API Management",
  "description": "AI workloads don’t behave like traditional APIs. They combine models, tools, and agents across providers, making routing, cost control, safety, and observability harder in production. Learn how to use Azure API Management’s AI Gateway to expose endpoints, route requests, and apply policies. Through demos, go from a single request to a production-ready setup with guardrails and telemetry.",
